        <h2>Where Craftsmanship Meets Passion</h2>
        <p>Founded in 2010, Lumina Jewelry began with a simple vision: to create exceptional jewelry that tells a story. Every piece is designed in our New York studio and handcrafted by master artisans using time-honored techniques passed down through generations.</p>
        <p>We believe that jewelry should be as unique as the moments it celebrates. From engagement rings that mark the beginning of forever, to everyday pieces that become cherished heirlooms, each creation carries our commitment to excellence.</p>
